<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">WAEFESO</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUPWILILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA WAEFESO</para>
  <para style="toc2">WAEFESO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efs.</para>
  <para style="mt2">LUPWILILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA</para>
  <para style="mt1">WAEFESO</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Lupwilili ha Waefeso lwandikigwa mkipigiti kimwe kilwandikigwe lupwilili ha Wakolosai muna imilao ya 60 songela kuvumbuka kwa Yesu Kilisto. Yandike lupwilili luno kakiitambula mwenyego kamba Paulo, mtumigwa wa Kilisto (1:1). Wasomi bwando wotogola kamba Paulo iyo yandike lupwilili lwa Waefeso hata kamba lupwilili luno lwabule ndamsa ya kiunhu kamba viili mulupwilili lwa Wakolosai. Mkilamso kino vodahika lupwilili luno lukala luzunguluka mmadale bwando ga wanhu wamtogole Kilisto ga isi ya Asia Ndodo. Paulo vivija kandika kamba kipigiti viyakalile yokwandika lupwilili luno kakala mkifungo (3:1, 4:1, na 6:20). Paulo kamgwelela Tikiko lupwilili luno kipigiti Tikiko viyakalile hanafungiligwa mwanza wa kuchola kuwatembelela wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wakalile mdiwambo da Efeso (6:21-22).</para>
  <para style="ip">Efeso dikala wambo kulu ng'hani na aho baho kukalile na boma da Kiloma muisi ya Asia Ndodo. Efeso ikala itangigwe ng'hani sama ya ng'anda ya mulungu wa kitwanzi wa Kigiliki yokemigwa Atemi (Sang'h. 19:23-31). Wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wa Efeso wasonga na mhiko ila hamwande wahuha (Lug. 2:1-7).</para>
  <para style="ip">Muna ulwenza lwa ichanduso lwa lupwilili luno Paulo kosimulila avija Mulungu viyawasagule wanhu zake na kuwakombola kulawa m'vilozo vao kubitila Yesu Kilisto. Kawalinga wanhu wamtogole Kilisto na lukuli lwa munhu na Kilisto kamba pala, na kawalinga wanhu wamtogole Kilisto na ng'anda na Kilisto kamba dibwe kulu da hakingolobweda. Muna ulwenza lwa ikabili lwa ulupwilili Paulo kolava ndagizi ha munhu yamtogole Kilisto avija vondayakale ukazi unogile.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulo kakiitambula mwenyego na kuwalamsa Waefeso (<char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Abaho kawalongela wanhu wamtogole Kilisto uhamoja uwalinao na Kilisto (<char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 1:3-3:21">1:3—3:21</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Abaho Paulo kowandikila wanhu wamtogole Kilisto vija vowolondigwa kukala (<char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 4:1-6:20">4:1—6:20</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Hakimambukizo, Paulo kolava masala ga kufunga lupwilili lwake (<char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 6:21-24">6:21-24</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>Lupwilili luno lolawa ha Paulo, mtumigwa wa Yesu Kilisto, yasaguligwe na manogelwa ga Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Nowandikila wanhu wa Mulungu wang'alile wali mdiwambo da Efeso,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyandiko ziyagwe za umwaka zabule </char><char style="fk" closed="false">mdiwambo da Efeso.</char></note> wanahina wa Kilisto walibule uzenzeleganye.<verse eid="EPH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Ngekewa na tindiwalo kulawa ha Mulungu Tata wetu na kulawa ha Mndewa Yesu Kilisto viwe hamoja namwe.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Motelo za Muloho Mkuilumba Hamoja na Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Tumgwelele nhogolwa Mulungu na Tata wa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto, ayo yotumoteza tweye mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto na motelo zose za muloho muulumwengu wa kuulanga, <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>kamba vija viyatusagule tweye mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto songela ulumwengu haunalumbigwa, giladi tung'ale na sambituwe na mbuli yoyose ihile hameso gake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">Sama ya noge jake <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>Mulungu kesha kulamula mwenyego kamba kubitila Yesu Kilisto katutenda tuwe wanage, vino vivo vimnogele mwenyego. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>Tumuyenzi Mulungu sama ya ngekewa ya yenzi yake, na sama ya nhunza ya bule iyatugwelele tweye kubitila Mwanage mnogelwa. <verse eid="EPH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/>Mkuilumba na heyo, tukomboligwa kubitila mulopa wake,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kubitila mulopa wake </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kubitila ifa yake mumsalaba.</char></note> vilozo vetu vigeligwa kumgongo, kamba vija vuuli ugoli wa ngekewa yake <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>uyatugwelele tweye bila mhima.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:8">Na ng'hungwe zose na utango wose, <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>Mulungu katenda tuitange nyong'onyo ya nogelwa yake kamba vija viyanogeligwe mwenyego kugatenda kubitila Kilisto. <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Kilondigwa kutendeka icho kino, mkipigiti kitogoligwe Mulungu kovikunzanya vinhu vose kumwake, vinhu vili kuulanga na vili muisi viwe hasi ya kilangizi imwe Yesu Kilisto.<verse eid="EPH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Sama ya kuilumba hamoja na Kilisto, Mulungu katusagula tuwe wanhu zake mwenyego songela haichanduso, na katenda vinhu vose visang'hanike kamba viyalondile mwenyego, <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>giladi kamba tweye, Wayahudi, tulongole kwika tamanilo jetu ha Kilisto, tukale mkuitogola yenzi yake.<verse eid="EPH 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Na mweye Wamhazi vivija mgaluka wanhu wa Mulungu kipigiti vimuhulike usenga wa ikweli, Usenga Unogile wa ukombola wenu. Vimumtogole Kilisto, Mulungu kawekila utango wake wa kulagusa kamba mweye mwa wanhu zake mkuwagwelela Loho wa Mulungu yekile nao kilagano. <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>Loho wa Mulungu iyo kingilambago kamba tweye tubokele gaja Mulungu gayekile kilagano ha wanhu zake, na mbuli ino yotugangamiza kamba Mulungu kolava ulegeho ha wanhu zake. Tumtogole Mulungu sama ya yenzi yake.<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhambiko ya Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Nihulika vija vumumtamanila Yesu na vija vumuwanogela wanhu wa Mulungu, na sama ya kilamso kino <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>silekile kumgwaa hewela Mulungu sama yenu, kamba viniwakumbuka mzinhambiko zangu. <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>Nogendelela kutambika kamba Tata yali na yenzi, ayo yali Mulungu wa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto, yawagwelele Loho wa Mulungu yali na ng'hungwe na lugubulo, giladi mumtange goya. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>Vivija notambika kamba nzonzi zenu zigubuligwe giladi mditange tamanilo diyawakemele, na vija vuuli mkulu ugoli wa motelo ziyekile kilagano ha wanhu zake. <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>Na notambika kamba muitange mhiko ng'hulu ya Mulungu ilibule mhima sama yetu tweye tutogola. Mhiko ino isang'hanika mgati yetu ya kamba vija mhiko ija ng'hulu <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/>Mulungu iyaigalile kipigiti cha kumzusa Kilisto kulawa mkudanganhika na kumwika kumkono wake wa ukulume kuulanga. <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>Kilisto kotawala haja na kuwa uchana ya watawala wose wa kuulanga, wali na udaho na mhiko, na wandewa, na kila twaga ditambuligwa, sio muulumwengu uno wiyeka, ila vivija na ulumwengu ukwiza. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/>Mulungu kavika vinhu vose hasi ya magulu ga Yesu, kamsagula heyo yawe kilangizi wa vinhu vose sama ya wanhu wamtogole Kilisto, <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>awo wali lukuli lwake, na kuleka kuhungula hanhu kamba viyali heyo, ayo yovimemeza vinhu vose mnzila zose.<verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Kulawa Mkudanganhika Kuchola Kuna Uugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Mweye, Wamhazi, mkala mdanganhike muloho sama ya udulu wenu na vilozo <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>vum'vitendile umwaka mkuwinza mbuli zihile za ulumwengu uno na kumuwinza mtawala wa vinyamkela yali kuulanga, loho yosang'hanika sambi mwa wanhu wadulu. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Na tweye tose tukala kamba hewo, tukala tuwinza sulukila za ng'huli zetu, tutenda gaja gosulukilwa na ng'huli zetu na nzewele zetu. Tukala wanhu tulumbile kutagusigwa kwavija Mulungu kakala yotonela lusango sama ya vilozo vetu, kamba wanhu wose wayagwe.<verse eid="EPH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Ila sama ya ukulu wa noge jake kumwetu, Mulungu, ayo yamemile bazi, <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>katutenda kuwa wagima kipigiti viyamzusile Kilisto kulawa mkudanganhika hata kamba tukala tudanganhike sama ya vilozo vetu. Mkomboligwa sama ya ngekewa ya Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Na Mulungu katuzusa tweye kulawa mkudanganhika hamoja na Kilisto na kutwika hamoja na heyo kuna uulumwengu wa kuulanga kwavija tuilumba hamoja na Kilisto Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>Katenda vino giladi mmilelo ikwiza yalaguse ngekewa yake ng'hulu iyaitendile mkipigiti kino kubitila mdinoge diyatulagusile tweye mkuilumba hamoja na Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>Kwavija mkomboligwa sama ya ngekewa ya Mulungu kubitila nhamanila, na si malawililo ga sang'hano zenu, ila nhunza kulawa ha Mulungu, <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>sio malawililo ga sang'hano, avo munhu yoyose sambiyaitope. <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Kwavija tweye twa uumbi wa Mulungu, tulumbigwe mkuilumba hamoja na Yesu Kilisto giladi tutende sang'hano zinogile, zitandigwe na Mulungu songela mwaka sama yetu giladi tuzitende.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuilumba na Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Avo, sambimuisemwe kamba umwaka mweye mkala Wamhazi mkuleligwa na kukemigwa “wanhu walekile kwingila kumbi” na waja wakiikemile wenyego “wengile kumbi,” kumbi da lukuli ditendigwe na makono ga wanhu. <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>Sambimuisemwe kamba kipigiti kija mweye mkala hamunam'bokela Kilisto. Hampetigwe kuwa wenekae wa Islaeli, na mkala wahenza mmalagano Mulungu gayailagane na wanhu zake. Mkala mwabule tamanilo muulumwengu na mwabule Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Ila sambi muilumba hamoja na Yesu Kilisto. Mweye umwaka mkalile kutali na Mulungu, sambi mgaligwa habehi na heyo kubitila mulopa wa Kilisto. <verse eid="EPH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Kwavija Kilisto mwenyego katugalila tindiwalo mkuwatenda Wayahudi na Wamhazi wawe hamoja. Na kubitila ifa yake mumsalaba kakibena kija ikiwambaza kikalile kiwabagule na kuwatenda wawe wadumuka. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>Kagasegeza Malagizo ga Musa hamoja na ndagizi zake na shalia zake. Kaditenda tindiwalo mwa Wayahudi na Wamhazi. Kaitendela heyo mwenyego dale dimwe da sambi kulawa mmadale gano mabili, <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>giladi madale gose mabili yagalumbe mulukuli lumwe na kugaduganyiza na Mulungu kubitila ifa yake mumsalaba, na udumuka wetu ukalile hagatigati yetu udanganhika. <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Avo Kilisto keza na kuupeta Usenga Unogile wa tindiwalo ha wanhu wose, kumwenu mweye Wamhazi mkalile kutali na Mulungu, na ha Wayahudi wakalile behi na heyo. <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Kwavija sama ya gaja Kilisto gayatendile kumwetu, tweye tose tupata nzila ya kuchola ha Tata kubitila Loho iija wa Mulungu.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Avo, mweye hamuli wahenza ama wabita nzila, ila mweye mwa wenekae hamoja na wanhu wa Mulungu, na vivija mweye mwa wanhu wa kae ya Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Mzengigwa uchana hana umsingi uwo watumigwa wa Kilisto na wahokozi, na Yesu Kilisto mwenyego iyo dibwe da kutamanilwa ng'hani kubanza mabwe gose. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto ng'anda yose yokiigoga hamoja na kwinuka na kugaluka Ng'anda ing'alile ya Mulungu ikigwe sama ya Mndewa. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Na mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto mweye Wamhazi vivija mozengigwa hamoja na kugaluka hanhu hoyokala Loho wa Mulungu.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Sang'hano ya Paulo mwa Wamhazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Mkilamso kino nie, Paulo, na mfungigwa wa Yesu Kilisto sama yenu mweye Wamhazi. <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Nokona muhulika vija Mulungu sama ya ngekewa yake viyangwelele nie sang'hano ino niitende sama yenu, <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>na vija nyong'onyo viigubuligwe kumwangu kubitila lugubulo, kamba vinishile kuyandika kidogo. <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>Na muhalusoma lupwilili luja, modaha kuvitanga vija viniimanya nyong'onyo ya Kilisto, <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>ilekile kutangigwa na wanhu wa milelo ibitile kamba viili sambi, avija viigubuligwe na Loho wa Mulungu ha watumigwa wa Mulungu wang'alile na wahokozi. <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Ino iyo inyong'onyo, kamba kubitila Usenga Unogile Wamhazi wohala hamoja na Waislaeli, wowa lukuli lumwe na wobokela hamoja kilagano mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Mulungu kanitenda niwe mtumigwa wa kuupeta Usenga Unogile na nhunza kisinyo iyangwelele nie kubitila sang'hano ya mhiko yake. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Hata kamba nie na munhu mdodo kubanza wanhu wose wa Mulungu, nhunza ino nigweleligwa giladi niwapetele Wamhazi ugoli wa Kilisto ulibule mbaka, <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>na kuwatenda wanhu wose wone vija nyong'onyo ya Mulungu iifisile vuisang'hanika. Mulungu, ayo yalumbile vinhu vose, kaifisa nyong'onyo yake milao yose ibitile. <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>Nia yake ikala vino, kubitila wanhu wamtogole Kilisto, ng'hungwe ya Mulungu, ili ya namna zose, sambi itendigwa itangigwe na watawala na wali na udaho muulumwengu wa kuulanga. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Mulungu katenda kamba vija viyalondile heyo mazua gose kubitila Yesu Kilisto Mndewa wetu. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Mkuilumba na heyo na kubitila nhamanila mgati yake, tomkwenhukila Mulungu mkuilegeha na bila kudumba. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Avo nowayalalila kamba sambimdonhe sama ya migayo yangu hano. Nie nogaya sama yenu, avo yowagalila hishima.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Noge da Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Sama ya kilamso kino nofugama mavindi haulongozi wa Tata, <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>ayo yalumbile kila kinhu cha kuulanga na cha muisi. <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>Notambika kamba, kamba vija vuuli ugoli wa yenzi yake, yadahe kuwagangamiza na mhiko kubitila Loho wake muunhu wenu wa mgati, <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>giladi Kilisto yakale mmioyo yenu kubitila nhamanila. Na notambika kamba muwe na mizizi na kugangamizwa mdinoge, <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>giladi mweye hamoja na wanhu wose wa Mulungu muwe na mhiko za kutambula vija noge da Kilisto vidili gazi na tali, na vija vidicholile uchana na vija vidicholile hasi, <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>na kuditanga noge da Kilisto dibanza nzewele za wanhu wose, giladi sambimuhungule hanhu kamba viyali Mulungu.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Yayenzigwe heyo Mulungu, ayo kubitila mhiko zake zisang'hanika mgati yetu yodaha kusang'hana mbuli ng'hulu ng'hani kubanza gaja gose gotudaha kugapula ama kugagelegeza. <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>Mulungu yayenzigwe mwa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto na ha Yesu Kilisto kubitila milelo yose, milongo yose. Amina.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Kuilumba na Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Nie nili mfungigwa sama ya Mndewa, avo, nowayalalila mkale ukazi ulondigwa na lukemo lwenu lumkemigwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>Mazua gose sambimuitope na muwe wanhu waholile, mwazaganye, na kuinogela wenyego kwa wenyego. <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Tendeni vija vumdaha kuutenda uhamoja wenu wa Muloho wa Mulungu ugendelele mkuifunga na tindiwalo. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Hana lukuli lumwe na Loho imwe wa Mulungu, kamba vija vumkemigwe na Mulungu mditamanilo dimwe da lukemo lwenu Mulungu luyawakemele. <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Hana Mndewa imwe yeiyeka, nhamanila imwe, ubatizo umwe, <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>Mulungu imwe na Tata wa wanhu wose, ayo yali uchana ya vinhu vose na kubitila vinhu vose na mgati ya vose.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Ila kila munhu mmwanza wetu kabokela nhunza kisinyo kamba Kilisto viyamgwelele. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Kamba Nyandiko Zing'alile vuzilonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">“Viyakwelile uchana ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">kakwela hamoja na wanhu bwando wagogigwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">Kawagwelela wanhu nhunza.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Vija viilongwa, “Kilisto kakwela uchana,” nhegulo yake choni? Nhegulo yake tanhu Kilisto kahumuluka mbaka hasi ng'hani muisi. <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Heyo yahumuluke iyo iija yakwelile uchana ya ulanga wose giladi yavimemeze vinhu vose. <verse eid="EPH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>Zino zizo nhunza Kilisto ziyawagwelele wanhu wamtogole heyo. Wanhu wayagwe kawasagula kuwa watumigwa wa Kilisto, na wayagwe kuwa wahokozi, na wayagwe kuwa wapeta Usenga Unogile, na wayagwe kuwa wachunga na wayagwe kuwa wakulufunzi wa Usenga wa Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>Katenda vino giladi yawatande wanhu wa Mulungu sama ya sang'hano yake, giladi lukuli lwa Kilisto luzengigwe, <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>mbaka na tweye tose vondatuuvikile uhamoja wa nhamanila na kuwa na ilimu ya Mwana wa Mulungu, na kuwa wanhu wakangale, na kuleka kuhungula hanhu kamba viyali Kilisto. <verse eid="EPH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Avo hatuwa tena kamba wana wadodo, tukunhizwa kuno na kuno na kuhembeluswa na kila beho da mafundo, ubala wa wanhu muuzenzeleganye, na mmbuli zao za uvwizi. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Ila mkulonga ikweli mdinoge, tokula mzimbuli zose na kuvikila kuwa kamba Kilisto, ayo yali ditwi da wanhu wamtogole heyo. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>Kolutenda lukuli lose lukiilumbe na kuigoga hamoja na vipindi vose viyagwe. Kila kipindi kihasang'hanika vinogile, cholutenda lukuli lukule na kuizenga lwenyego mdinoge.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukala Kamba Wana wa Mulangaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Avo nowalongela na kuwagong'ondeza mditwaga da Mndewa, sambimkale ukazi kamba vowokala Wamhazi, mkuwinza ngelegeza zao zihile. <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>Nzonzi zao zigeligwa ziza, na wekigwa kutali na ugima wa Mulungu sama ya ubozi uli mgati yao na udala wa mioyo yao. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Wanhu walibule kinyala, wekiingiza wenyego mzimbuli zihile na kutenda vinhu vose vihile bila kudumba.<verse eid="EPH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Ila hivo sio vumuifunzile mmbuli ya Kilisto! <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>Muhulika mbuli za Yesu, na mfundizwa kweli kulawa kumwake. <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>Avo ulekeni unhu wenu wa umwaka awo umemile vilozo, na ulekeni ukazi wenu wa umwaka awo uwabanange mweye mkuwengiza muuvwizi na sulukila ya ugoni. <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Mtendigwe wa sambi mngelegeza za nzonzi zenu, <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>na muuvale unhu wa sambi, ulumbigwe na kuwa kamba Mulungu, unhu wa kweli, ulibule uzenzeleganye na ung'alile.<verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Avo, kila munhu mmwanza wenu yaleke uvwizi na yalonge kweli ha miyage, kwavija tweye tose twa vipindi va lukuli lumwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>Kamba muhawa na lusango, sambimtende vilozo. Zua sambidiswe kuno mng'hali na lusango. <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Sambimumgwelele Mwenembago nafasi. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Awo wose wokwiba waleke ubavi wao, ila wasang'hanike ng'hani na makono gao wenyego, giladi wapate kinhu cha kumgwaa mkumbulu. <verse eid="EPH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Milomo yenu sambiilave mbuli zihile, ila mbuli zinogile sama ya kuwazenga wanhu wayagwe mnhamanila, kulingana na vija vowolonda, giladi waja wotegeleza wagangamizwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Sambimumgele giogio Loho wa Mulungu, kwavija Loho ija iyo utango wa Mulungu wikigwe kumwenu kulagusa kamba mweye mwa wanhu zake mbaka zua dija Mulungu vondayawakombole. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Segezeni usungu wose, lusango lose, nyangi zose, na kuilonga vihile kose, hamoja na kuilondela gehile. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Muwe na mioyo inogile na kwiyonela bazi wenyego kwa wenyego, na kila munhu yamgele kumgongo miyage kamba vija Mulungu viyawagelile mweye kumgongo kubitila Kilisto.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Kukala Muna Umulangaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Avo, mwigeni Mulungu, kamba wana wanogelwa, <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>na mkale ukazi wa kuinogela, kamba Kilisto viyatunogele tweye na kukiilava mwenyego sama yetu kamba nhunza inung'hila goya na nhosa imnogela Mulungu.<verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Ila ugoni na mbuli zozose zihile ama ugila sambivipetigwe mmwanza wenu, kwavija mbuli zino hazilondigwa kutendeka mmwanza wa wanhu wa Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Na sambikuwe na mbuli zigela kinyala ama mbuli za ubozi ama mbuli za miselezo zilekile kulumba, ila mumgwelele hewela Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>M'vitange kamba haduhu munhu mgoni ama munhu yotenda mbuli zihile ama munhu yosulukila vinhu bwando, nhegulo yake munhu yoitambikila miwegu, yondayauhale Undewa wa Kilisto na wa Mulungu.<verse eid="EPH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Munhu sambiyawavwizile na mbuli za uvwizi, kwavija sama ya mbuli zino lusango lwa Mulungu lowezila waja wose woleka kumtegeleza. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Avo sambimuiduganye na hewo. <verse eid="EPH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Kwavija umwaka mkala mdiziza da vilozo, ila sambi mwa mmulangaza wa kuwa bule uzenzeleganye mkuilumba na Mndewa. Mkale kamba wana wa mulangaza. <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>Kwavija malawililo ga mulangaza gago gano, unovu wose, kuwa bule uzenzeleganye kose, na kweli yose. <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Zahileni gaja goyomnogela Mndewa. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Sambimtende mbuli za ziza zileka kulela mujo, ila zifisuleni. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>Kwavija kinyala hata kugalonga gaja gotendeka kinyele na wanhu woleka kuzigoga mbuli za Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Ila chochose kifisuligwe na mulangaza chokoneka vija vukili, <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>kwavija mulangaza uwo utenda kila kinhu choneke. Avo, kileka mana ilongwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Lamuka mzimbuli za Mulungu, gweye uwasile mzimbuli za vilozo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">uzuke kulawa mkudanganhika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">na Kilisto kokumwemwesela.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Muiteganye vija vumkala. Sambimkale kamba wanhu walibule ng'hungwe, ila mkale kamba wanhu wali na ng'hungwe. <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>Kila kipigiti kimulinacho tendeni ganogile ng'hani, kwavija kipigiti kino kiha. <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Avo, sambimuwe wabozi, ila mkitange kija Mulungu choyolonda mweye mkitende.<verse eid="EPH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Sambimkoligwe na divai, kwavija kukoligwa kowengiza mzimbuli zihile, ila mmemezigwe na Loho wa Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Mkiimbile wenyego kwa wenyego na zabuli, nyila za kumtogola Mulungu, na nyila za muloho. Mwimbileni na kumuheweza Mndewa mmioyo yenu. <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Mazua gose mumgwelele hewela Mulungu tata sama ya mbuli zose mditwaga da Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Watwanzi Wasoligwe na Wambigalo Wasolile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Kila munhu yawe mwende ha miyage sama ya hishima ya Kilisto.<verse eid="EPH 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Kila mtwanzi yawe mwende ha mbigalo wake kamba viyali mwende ha Mndewa. <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Kwavija mbigalo iyo pala da mtwanzi wake, kamba vija Kilisto viyali pala da wanhu wamtogole Kilisto. Na heyo iyo Mkombola wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto, awo wali lukuli lwake. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Na kila mtwanzi na yawe mwende ha mbigalo wake mzimbuli zose kamba vija wanhu wamtogole Kilisto viwali wende ha Kilisto.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Na gweye mbigalo, mnogele mtwanzi wako kamba vija Kilisto viyawanogele wanhu wamtogole heyo na kukiilava mwenyego sama yao. <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>Katenda vino giladi yawatende wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wang'ale mmoyo na wang'ale mulukuli, wasuluzwe na mazi na kung'alizwa na mbuli ya Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>Katenda vino giladi yaitendele heyo mwenyego wanhu wamtogole heyo wanogile na walibule nyela ama mikunzo ama vilozo viyagwe vovose. Ila wawe wanhu wang'alile na walibule mbuli yoyose ihile. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Na kila mbigalo yamnogele mtwanzi wake kamba voyolunogela lukuli lwake. Munhu yomnogela mtwanzi wake kokiinogela mwenyego. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>Kwavija haduhu munhu yoyose yolwihila lukuli lwake, ila kolugwaa mandia na kulutendela vululonda, kamba Kilisto voyowatendela wanhu wamtogole heyo, <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>kwavija tweye twa vipindi va lukuli lwake. <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/>Kamba viyandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, “Mkilamso kino mbigalo kowaleka tataake na mamaake na kuilumba na mwehe wake, na wabili wano wowa lukuli lumwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">MWANDUSO 2:24</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Kuna nyong'onyo ng'hulu ng'hani igubuligwe Mnyandiko ino Ing'alile, na vino vivo viyali Kilisto na wanhu wamtogole heyo. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Ila kila munhu mmwanza wenu kolondigwa yamnogele mtwanzi wake kamba viyokinogela mwenyego, na mtwanzi kolondigwa yamuhishimile mbigalo wake.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Wana na Watata Zao na Wamama Zao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Mweye wana, wategelezeni watata zenu na wamama zenu kwavija mweye mwa wanhu wa Mndewa, kwavija vino vivo vilondigwa. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>“Muhishimile tataako na mamaako,” ino iyo indagizi ya ichanduso ili na kilagano, <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>“giladi upate motelo na ukale kipigiti kitali muisi.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Mweye watata, sambimuwagele lusango wanenu, ila muwalele mkuwazuma na malagizo ga Mndewa.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyakadala na Wakulu Zao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Mweye nyakadala, iweni wende ha wandewa zenu wali hano muisi mkuwadumba na mkuwagudemela na mmoyo ugoloke, kamba vija vimumsang'hanikila Kilisto. <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>Sambimtende gano kipigiti wahawa baho tu, giladi wawanogeleni. Ila kamba nyakadala wa Kilisto, tendeni gaja goyomnogela Mulungu kulawa mmioyo yenu. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Sang'haneni sang'hano zenu na moyo ugoloke, kamba vija momsang'hanikila Mndewa na sio wanhu, <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>kuno m'vitanga kamba Mndewa komgwelela nhunza munhu yoyose sama ya kinhu chochose kinogile choyotenda, yawe nyakadala ama munhu yailegehe.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Na mweye wanhu muli na nyakadala, watendeleni vinogile nyakadala zenu. Sambimuwadumbize, ila m'vitange kamba mweye mose muna Mndewa imwe ayo yali kuulanga, na heyo halola kihanga cha munhu.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ng'hondo ya Muloho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Hakimambukizo, mgangamale mkuilumba hamoja na Mndewa na muudaho wa mhiko zake. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Valeni via vose va kuiimilizila vumgweleligwe na Mulungu giladi mdahe kuuhuma ubala wa Mwenembago. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Kwavija tweye hatutenda ng'hondo na wanhu wa ulumwengu uno, ila totenda ng'hondo na watawala, na wali na udaho, na wali na mhiko za ziza za ulumwengu uno, na dale da vinyamkela dili kuulanga. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Sama ya kilamso kino, valeni via vose va kuiimilizila viyawagwelele Mulungu, giladi mdahe kwima mkipigiti cha kulawilila mbuli zihile, na ng'hondo ihesha, mgangamale.<verse eid="EPH 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>Avo mkale muisasale, kweli iwe kamba lukumbulu lwa kuifunga mchuno, kuwa bule uzenzeleganye kuwe kamba kuvala koti da zuma mmhambaga, <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/>na kuisasala kuupeta Usenga Unogile wa tindiwalo kuwe kamba vilatu mmagulu genu. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Hamoja na gano gose, papeni nhamanila kamba ngao, ayo yondaiwatende mdahe kuizima misale ikwaka moto kulawa ha Mwenembago. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Ubokeleni ukombola uwe kamba kofia da zuma, na Usenga wa Mulungu, awo uli kamba zele diyawagwelele Loho wa Mulungu. <figure style="fig" alt="Roman soldier armor" file="RomanSoldierInArmor_Rom13.12_GT00122.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="6:11-17">Via va Kuiimilizila</figure> <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Tambikeni kubitila Loho wa Mulungu mazua gose mnhambiko zose na kupula. Gendeleleni kutambika bila kudonha na muhatambika sambimuleke kuwatambikila wanhu wose wa Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Vivija na nie munitambikile, giladi nihalonda kulonga basi Mulungu yangwelele cha kulonga, nilonge bila kudumba na kugagubula gaifisile Muusenga Unogile, <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>awo unhendile nie kuwa msenga, hata kamba sambisambi na mkifungo. Tambikeni giladi nidahe kuupeta bila kidumbo kamba vinilondigwa.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndamsa za Kimambukizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>Tikiko iyo ndugu mnogelwa na mtumigwa yalibule uzenzeleganye muisang'hano ya Mndewa. Kowalongela mbuli zangu zose, giladi na mweye vivija m'vitange vija vinili na kija kinitenda. <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Nomtuma kumwenu sama ya mbuli zino, m'vitange vija vituli na vivija yawagangamize mweye mioyo yenu.<verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Tindiwalo diwe ha wanhu wose wamtogole Kilisto, na noge hamoja na nhamanila kulawa ha Mulungu Tata na kulawa ha Mndewa Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Ngekewa ya Mulungu iwe hamoja na wanhu wose womnogela Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto mdinoge dilibule nziga.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
